From 24639a4c3639585d9b2fe566f56a7f220806808b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: legsmechanical <joshgaine@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2026 10:01:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] feat(fx): send FX presets, per-bus return level,
 ui_hierarchy fallback

Checkpoint B (C side) of send FX Phase 2:
- Send preset CRUD in chain_host.c (bus-parameterized: presets_send_a/_b dirs,
  3 slots, JSON root "send_fx"; save/update/delete + count/name/json param keys).
- Per-bus return level: shadow_send_return_level[SEND_BUS_COUNT] with
  send_fx:{a,b}:return_level SET/GET in both shadow_chain_mgmt.c handler paths,
  applied to the bus return in schwung_shim.c accumulate/return mix, and a global
  fallback persisted in shadow_state.c (per-set override lives in the JS sidecar).
- Send ui_hierarchy GET now falls back to module.json (mirrors the master_fx
  handler) so modules that declare ui_hierarchy there but not via live get_param
  (e.g. dissolver) can open their param editor on a send.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
